{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24003","headline":"雪後早过天津桥偶呈诸客 · 白居易","name":"雪後早过天津桥偶呈诸客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官桥晴雪晓峩峩，老尹行吟独一过。\n紫绶相辉应不恶，白须同色复如何。\n悠扬短景凋年急，牢落衰情感事多。\n犹赖洛中饶醉客，时时䛏我唤笙歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24003.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24003","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}